# Opportunity OS — standalone product law

Full spec: `docs/OPPORTUNITY-OS-MASTER-SPEC.md` · Kebu personalized layer: `docs/KEBU-OPPORTUNITY-OS.md`.

## Product identity (non-negotiable)

**Opportunity OS is a SEPARATE PRODUCT** from Kebu and from **Kebu Opportunity OS**.

| | Opportunity OS | Kebu Opportunity OS |
|--|----------------|---------------------|
| **Job** | Continent-scale explore — evidence, trade, resources, cards, labs | For-you matching inside Kebu account |
| **Database / APIs** | Own schemas and product boundary | Kebu account + entitlements; calls Opportunity OS via API when needed |
| **UI** | Discovery, countries, cards, map, research — **not** Builder | Intake, personalized plan, handoff to Builder/Kebu ID |
| **Merge?** | **Never** merge identities, nav, or schemas | Stays a Kebu feature module |

Integration = **APIs only** (e.g. Build This → Kebu). Never auto-publish. Never collapse into Builder.

## Nature

```
DATA → RESEARCH → PATTERNS → GAPS → OPPORTUNITY → BUSINESS MODEL → ACTION
```

Not a blog, directory, news site, or ChatGPT wrapper. Trust labels mandatory. AI reasons on **retrieved** data.

## Slice order

Country Explorer → Opportunity Card → Discovery → Trade → Import Replacement → Value Addition → Research Lab → Think Labs → …

One vertical slice at a time. End-to-end only.

## Code in this monorepo

Explore domain: `lib/opportunity/*`, `app/opportunity/countries/*`, `app/api/opportunity/countries/*` — treat as **Opportunity OS**, not Kebu Builder.

Do not put full Research Lab / Think Lab CMS inside Builder UI.
